  "body": "Since PR #3254 (merged 2026-11-22 10:44 UTC), both jobs of `cut.yml` run on `runs-on: [self-hosted, camcraft-cut]`. A cut queues until a runner carries that label.\n\nOnly the maintainer can add it: Settings -> Actions -> Runners -> `wopr` -> Labels -> add `camcraft-cut`. Our account cannot read runner labels (`actions/runners` returns 403), so this cannot be checked from our side.\n\nOptional check without a cut: `gh workflow run cut.yml -f version=<next> -f stage=gate -f dry_run=true` should start on `wopr` within a minute.\n\nAfter that, the stop-gap on our side (pausing the other post-merge runners while a release PR is open) can be retired.\n\n**Done means:** `wopr` carries `camcraft-cut`, and a `dry_run` cut (or the next real cut) starts on it.\n",
